            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><p><strong>Name of the hotel:</strong> {{1}}</p><p class=\"sub-head\">Major changes</p><ul><li>signboard: the {{2}} needs to be bigger</li><li>swimming pool: to be relocated from the {{3}} to the {{4}}</li><li>resting area: turn the {{5}} room into reception</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Notice board</p><ul><li>translation needed: {{6}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Price board</p><ul><li>current colour: {{7}}</li></ul><p><strong>Construction:</strong> starts before {{8}}</p><p><strong>Manager's name:</strong> {{9}} Barron</p><p><strong>Telephone number:</strong> {{10}}</p></div>",
            "maxWords": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "title": "Part 2",
        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 11–15</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 11,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What is the new activity in the zoo in November?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "evening tours"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "bonfire nights for adults"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "various parties"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 12,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What is the most popular species in the zoo?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "kangaroo"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "koala"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "sheepdog"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 13,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What is the key to feeding kangaroos?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "feeding more than one at a time"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "gently touching the baby kangaroos"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "standing up straight when feeding"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 14,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Why is the wild dog area closed?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "The wild dogs are unwell."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "The enclosure is under repair."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "The dogs have not arrived."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 15,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Where can visitors get discount tickets this year?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "at the café"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "on the official website"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "at the gift shop"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
