            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Suburbs</strong></div><p class=\"sub-head\">People living in the suburbs</p><ul><li>labour workers, {{31}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Advantages of living in the suburbs</p><ul><li>Tax and the prices of {{32}} are low.</li><li>It is easy to start a {{33}}.</li><li>Building {{34}} housing areas to meet the demand of a growing population.</li><li>People have more {{35}} because of wider roads.</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Problem</p><ul><li>lack of space for {{36}} in the suburbs</li></ul></div>",
